				<r3d:description language="eng">PharmGKB is a comprehensive resource that curates knowledge about the impact of genetic variation on drug response for clinicians and researchers. PharmGKB brings together the relevant data in a single place and adds value by combining disparate data on the same relationship, making it easier to search and easier to view the key aspects and by interpreting the data.PharmGKB provide clinical interpretations of this data, curated pathways and VIP summaries which are not found elsewhere.</r3d:description>
